<Project>

  <!-- Intentionally empty.

       midi/ is archived and not built (UWP + netcoreapp1.1). MSBuild stops its
       walk-up at the first Directory.Build.props it finds, so this file shields
       the legacy projects here from the repo-root defaults (net10.0 TFM, nullable,
       implicit usings, SourceLink), which they cannot satisfy.

       The three UWP apps (DrumPadMachine, IntervalCalculator, OpenJam) are slated
       for a rewrite as Blazor apps against MusicTheory; this file goes away then. -->

</Project>
